# 6. Data Type Correction

Each column was checked to ensure that it had an appropriate data type.

### Examples

| Data     | Correct Type    |
| -------- | --------------- |
| ID       | String          |
| Date     | Datetime        |
| Age      | Integer         |
| Sales    | Float           |
| Quantity | Integer         |
| Gender   | Category/String |

### Example Code

```python
